---
import '../../../../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>VERT · WebPC</title></head>
<body><header><strong>VERT</strong><span id="vert-status" role="status">Opening local converter…</span><nav aria-label="Converter actions"><button id="vert-stop" disabled>Stop conversions</button><button id="vert-reload">Reload</button><button id="vert-help">Help</button></nav></header>
<p id="vert-error" role="alert" hidden></p><main><iframe id="vert-frame" title="VERT converter" allow="clipboard-write"></iframe><section id="vert-loading" aria-label="Converter loading"><h1>Opening VERT</h1><p>Preparing the interface. Conversion engines load locally when you add a file.</p><button id="vert-retry" hidden>Try again</button></section></main>
<dialog id="vert-help-dialog" aria-labelledby="vert-help-title"><h2 id="vert-help-title">Convert on your device</h2><p>Add a file, choose an output format, then convert and download the result. VERT’s actual image, audio, document and supported browser video converters run here. Files are not uploaded; remote conversion servers, analytics and payment services are disabled.</p><p>The first use of an engine downloads its local WebAssembly files. Formats and performance depend on your browser. This embedded edition uses single-threaded FFmpeg; libvips and vectorization need isolation and are unavailable here. Large files can exceed browser memory. This is not a promise of every-format compatibility.</p><p>Minimize keeps work available. Close is blocked during an active conversion: stop it first. Closing an idle window keeps its files in this desktop session, but reloading VERT or closing the browser page loses them. Download important results. Files are not saved as a permanent library; VERT may use temporary browser storage while converting.</p><p>Settings → Privacy resets only VERT preferences/cache. Other WebPC apps’ storage is preserved.</p><p>Based on <a href="https://github.com/VERT-sh/VERT/tree/35ebeb1679eb0b1af3f099c03060cb89f72e70f8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">VERT</a> · <a href="/third-party/vert/modified-source.tar.gz" download>Modified source (AGPL-3.0)</a> · <a href="/third-party/vert/NOTICE.txt" target="_blank">Notices</a></p><form method="dialog"><button>Close help</button></form></dialog>
<script>import '../../../../scripts/pc/apps/vert.mjs';</script>
</body></html>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden}body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-bg)}header{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background:var(--color-surface)}header strong{font-size:14px}#vert-status{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:11px}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-left:auto}button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 9px;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:2px}button:hover:enabled{border-color:var(--color-accent)}main{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:0}iframe{border:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:var(--color-bg)}#vert-loading{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:24px;text-align:center;background:var(--color-bg);gap:12px}#vert-loading h1{font-size:24px;margin:0}#vert-loading p{color:var(--color-text-muted);max-width:400px}#vert-error{margin:0;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface)}[hidden]{display:none!important}dialog{max-width:580px;width:calc(100% - 32px);max-height:85vh;overflow:auto;padding:24px;line-height:1.7;background:var(--color-bg);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:10px}dialog h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 16px}dialog p{margin:0 0 16px}a{color:var(--color-accent)}dialog::backdrop{background:#0009}@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:6px 8px;gap:5px}nav{margin-left:0}#vert-status{flex:1}button{font-size:11px;padding:5px 7px}}
</style>
